  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Relief fund typhoons Agaton and Malakas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After the floods of January 2021 and Typhoon Rai that hit the Philippines last December at Christmas, the country was once again hit by two consecutive typhoons Agaton and Malakas, that struck in mid-April on the islands of Panay and Negros, where our 3 centers as well as the dormitory and CAMELEON offices are located. The winds reached 150 km per hour in some areas. We are appealing to your generosity in order to provide first aid and to make future home repairs for our beneficiaries.</narrative>
  </description>
